WEBVTT

00:00:24.910 --> 00:00:26.870
Miyako.

00:00:26.870 --> 00:00:28.620
Huh?

00:00:32.160 --> 00:00:37.290
Nothing surprises you. Good morning, Claudia.

00:00:37.290 --> 00:00:40.080
My beloved daughter.

00:02:11.660 --> 00:02:17.040
Must I say it again?
I am not your daughter, Odin.

00:02:13.120 --> 00:02:17.040
Episode 3
 Disaster Recovery Assessment!

00:02:18.120 --> 00:02:20.290
Hmph. You're no fun.

00:02:20.290 --> 00:02:24.700
And yet, I've always loved you as if you were.

00:02:24.700 --> 00:02:29.080
While I do appreciate you siding with humanity,

00:02:29.080 --> 00:02:32.240
this and that are separate matters.

00:02:32.240 --> 00:02:37.290
Such a stubborn daughter.
But that's what makes you so cute.

00:02:37.290 --> 00:02:40.080
Why did you bring me here?

00:02:40.080 --> 00:02:44.080
Must I have a reason? I'm quite bored.

00:02:44.080 --> 00:02:48.700
I'm complying with this isolation
to appease the cowardly humans.

00:02:48.700 --> 00:02:52.160
I shouldn't be punished over one simple visit.

00:02:52.160 --> 00:02:56.410
If you're a god, how can they punish you?

00:02:56.410 --> 00:02:59.040
That's a good point!

00:02:59.040 --> 00:03:02.160
I walked right into that one, Claudia!

00:03:03.080 --> 00:03:05.740
By the way, Claudia...

00:03:05.740 --> 00:03:08.200
You've been on a roll lately.

00:03:08.200 --> 00:03:10.330
On a roll?

00:03:11.990 --> 00:03:15.040
With the Pillars you call "Secondary."

00:03:15.040 --> 00:03:19.740
Never before have they fallen
in such quick succession.

00:03:19.740 --> 00:03:23.490
I was concerned when
you were sent to the Far East,

00:03:23.490 --> 00:03:25.910
but you haven't disappointed.

00:03:25.910 --> 00:03:29.120
You brought me here just to tell me that?

00:03:29.120 --> 00:03:33.740
Of course. I praise my daughter
when she does well.

00:03:33.740 --> 00:03:36.830
Am I not the perfect father?

00:03:36.830 --> 00:03:38.740
Also...

00:03:38.740 --> 00:03:41.080
Ortlinde has died.

00:03:41.490 --> 00:03:44.540
Even I have things on my mind.

00:03:47.490 --> 00:03:50.290
Keep up your good work.

00:03:50.290 --> 00:03:52.830
The decisive battle will come.

00:03:52.830 --> 00:03:57.830
Until then, muster as
much strength as you're able.

00:03:57.830 --> 00:04:00.330
As in, Ragnarök?

00:04:05.290 --> 00:04:08.490
Take care now.

00:04:08.490 --> 00:04:12.950
Go and show me that wonderful smile of yours.

00:04:16.290 --> 00:04:18.830
Thank you for your praise.

00:04:18.830 --> 00:04:22.660
However, it wasn't achieved
by my strength alone.

00:04:24.410 --> 00:04:26.490
You're right.

00:04:26.490 --> 00:04:31.120
I'm glad you're getting
along with your new friends.

00:04:31.120 --> 00:04:35.330
Let's hope you don't kill them this time,

00:04:35.330 --> 00:04:38.700
Grim Reaper Claudia.

00:04:43.410 --> 00:04:44.950
Here!

00:04:48.040 --> 00:04:50.740
I'm surprised you knew it was me.

00:04:50.740 --> 00:04:56.200
I thought I saw you when I was cleaning,
but then you disappeared.

00:04:56.200 --> 00:04:59.200
I figured you went to Odie's.

00:04:59.200 --> 00:05:03.160
Odie's? You and your nicknames...

00:05:05.700 --> 00:05:10.290
Hey, hey! Was Odie in a good mood?

00:05:10.290 --> 00:05:15.290
Ahem! I wonder...
He seemed the same as usual.

00:05:15.290 --> 00:05:20.370
I don't see him enough to know.
He says I'm too loud and hates me.

00:05:20.370 --> 00:05:23.790
Odin does? Even though you're a Valkyrie?

00:05:23.790 --> 00:05:28.790
But not you! You're Odie's favorite!
You get along!

00:05:28.790 --> 00:05:30.790
You think?

00:05:30.790 --> 00:05:32.950
It doesn't feel that way.

00:05:32.950 --> 00:05:37.240
Are you here for
morning training again? Atta girl!

00:05:37.240 --> 00:05:41.370
And what about you? Why are you here this early?

00:05:41.200 --> 00:05:49.250
Immovable Mind

00:05:41.370 --> 00:05:43.740
Cleaning and training!

00:05:43.740 --> 00:05:49.410
I'm like the only one who uses the dojo,
so it's nice to have company!

00:05:49.410 --> 00:05:51.660
Morning training? You?

00:05:51.660 --> 00:05:56.040
I grew up in a dojo, so it's part of my routine!

00:05:57.990 --> 00:06:02.120
But I can't today. I'm off to the cafeteria!

00:06:02.120 --> 00:06:05.370
It's way too early for breakfast.

00:06:05.370 --> 00:06:09.410
No, no! It's my turn to make it today!

00:06:09.410 --> 00:06:12.490
Breakfast? You're making it?

00:06:12.490 --> 00:06:15.160
I sure am! Oh, hey!

00:06:15.160 --> 00:06:19.410
Since you're here, why don't you help?!
Everyone will love it!

00:06:20.580 --> 00:06:25.450
Looking good! If you don't
know what to do, just ask!

00:06:25.450 --> 00:06:29.950
To be honest, I've got no idea--
Whoa! Miyako, it's alive!

00:06:29.950 --> 00:06:32.870
Yeah, it's a spunky one.

00:06:32.870 --> 00:06:36.080
Can you get the plates ready?

00:06:37.490 --> 00:06:39.620
You move like magic.

00:06:39.620 --> 00:06:41.540
Practice makes perfect!

00:06:41.540 --> 00:06:46.240
Cooking needs love,
but technique helps you mix it in!

00:06:46.910 --> 00:06:48.290
Taste it.

00:06:51.410 --> 00:06:52.540
It's good!

00:06:52.540 --> 00:06:55.540
If you love to cook, it's easy to learn!

00:06:55.540 --> 00:07:00.330
Learning is a matter of loving, huh?
Makes sense.

00:07:00.330 --> 00:07:01.790
Right?

00:07:03.540 --> 00:07:06.620
Okay, okay! Line up nice and neat!

00:07:06.620 --> 00:07:09.290
That was tougher than I thought.

00:07:09.290 --> 00:07:11.290
Good work, Clo.

00:07:10.120 --> 00:07:15.620
Claudy

00:07:11.290 --> 00:07:14.790
Morning, Sonoka. Huh? Clo?

00:07:14.790 --> 00:07:20.120
Yup! Since we're buddies now,
I want to call you like I do the others.

00:07:20.120 --> 00:07:21.990
Miko.

00:07:21.990 --> 00:07:23.200
Clo.

00:07:23.200 --> 00:07:24.450
Azu.

00:07:24.450 --> 00:07:26.540
Where is she? Sleeping?

00:07:26.540 --> 00:07:29.040
Azu's not a morning person.

00:07:29.040 --> 00:07:30.700
Thanks for waiting!

00:07:30.700 --> 00:07:33.240
Miyako's so good at that.

00:07:33.240 --> 00:07:36.660
Are you surprised since she seems clumsy?

00:07:36.660 --> 00:07:38.660
I wouldn't go that far.

00:07:38.660 --> 00:07:44.160
The truth is, she's really good
at cooking and all sorts of chores.

00:07:44.160 --> 00:07:47.580
I take it back. That does surprise me.

00:07:47.580 --> 00:07:50.660
Hmm? What are you two talking about?

00:07:50.660 --> 00:07:54.830
Clo is surprised by all of your domestic skills.

00:07:54.830 --> 00:07:56.660
Sonoka...

00:07:56.660 --> 00:07:59.990
It's fine, it's fine! I always hear that.

00:07:59.990 --> 00:08:04.450
I grew up in a strict household.
My mom always told me:

00:08:04.450 --> 00:08:10.950
"You're pretty cute, but not that smart,
so learn how to do the housework."

00:08:10.950 --> 00:08:16.160
Miko's such a well-bred woman.
She's even graceful using chopsticks!

00:08:16.160 --> 00:08:21.410
Hmm? Just so you know,
I'm not so bad with chopsticks myself.

00:08:21.410 --> 00:08:24.330
Did you learn chopsticks from your dad?

00:08:24.330 --> 00:08:27.160
Yeah, I did.

00:08:27.160 --> 00:08:29.120
He drilled it into me.

00:08:29.120 --> 00:08:31.740
Your father did? Why?

00:08:31.740 --> 00:08:36.620
She told me he loved Japan!
Doesn't that make you happy?

00:08:36.620 --> 00:08:38.870
Really? That's great!

00:08:38.870 --> 00:08:39.450
Erk!

00:08:39.450 --> 00:08:41.240
Huh? What's wrong, Claudy?

00:08:41.240 --> 00:08:44.160
Raw fish. I can't handle it.

00:08:44.160 --> 00:08:49.160
What?! It's so tasty!
You won't grow tall if you're picky!

00:08:49.160 --> 00:08:53.410
But Sonoka eats everything,
and she's still a shorty.

00:08:53.410 --> 00:08:57.330
All her growth goes to her boobs.
Can't you tell?

00:08:57.330 --> 00:08:59.990
D-Don't stare, pervert!

00:08:59.990 --> 00:09:02.950
You're all too spunky for this early.

00:09:02.950 --> 00:09:07.700
Morning, Azu! What a surprise! Are you eating?

00:09:07.700 --> 00:09:13.290
Ugh, no. I don't think I can stomach it. Huh?

00:09:13.290 --> 00:09:15.240
I'll have this though.

00:09:15.240 --> 00:09:17.950
That's bad manners, Azu!

00:09:17.950 --> 00:09:20.910
Here, sit up!

00:09:20.910 --> 00:09:23.160
Hold your chopsticks!

00:09:23.160 --> 00:09:26.240
Argh, sheesh! I'll just have to feed you!

00:09:26.240 --> 00:09:29.580
You Valkyries are lively this morning.

00:09:26.240 --> 00:09:29.580
Come on, come on! Sit up straight!

00:09:29.580 --> 00:09:32.370
Oh! Good morning, Commander!

00:09:32.370 --> 00:09:35.160
Yup! Good morning, everyone.

00:09:35.160 --> 00:09:39.080
Looks like you finally
opened up around these guys.

00:09:39.080 --> 00:09:41.120
Not that I was concerned.

00:09:41.120 --> 00:09:45.330
Yup! We're bestest friends, Commander!

00:09:47.540 --> 00:09:49.330
Good, good!

00:09:49.330 --> 00:09:53.330
Didn't get much sleep?
I see a lot of yawning this morning.

00:09:53.330 --> 00:09:57.120
I've got plenty of reasons for losing sleep.

00:09:57.120 --> 00:10:00.370
So, what are you guys doing today?

00:09:59.200 --> 00:10:04.210
June Menu

00:09:59.200 --> 00:10:04.210
Breakfast

00:09:59.200 --> 00:10:04.210
Lunch

00:09:59.200 --> 00:10:04.210
Dinner

00:10:00.370 --> 00:10:01.990
Nothing as of now.

00:10:01.990 --> 00:10:04.370
I'm meeting with maintenance.

00:10:04.370 --> 00:10:06.330
For more modifications?

00:10:06.330 --> 00:10:08.950
To check my Hero Wing. Actual work.

00:10:08.950 --> 00:10:12.620
In that case,
I've got something for the rest of you.

00:10:12.620 --> 00:10:18.160
I'd like you to go on a disaster
recovery assessment of Umihotaru.

00:10:18.160 --> 00:10:19.330
Umihotaru...

00:10:19.330 --> 00:10:24.080
An assessment?
But why ask us to do it specifically?

00:10:24.080 --> 00:10:29.740
It was an irregular situation,
so the area might still be affected.

00:10:29.580 --> 00:10:37.570
Claudy

00:10:29.740 --> 00:10:32.790
If it is, the only ones who can tell--

00:10:32.790 --> 00:10:38.040
Are those with Odin's divine
protection--us Valkyries.

00:10:38.040 --> 00:10:41.120
Understood. Mission accepted.

00:10:41.120 --> 00:10:43.200
Roger. We'll check it out.

00:10:43.200 --> 00:10:46.160
Um, Commander? But I...

00:10:46.160 --> 00:10:51.160
Miyako, I've got you covered.
I'll let you know if anything changes.

00:10:51.160 --> 00:10:52.870
Azu...

00:10:52.870 --> 00:10:57.740
You know you can trust me!
So can I give you a rocket engine too?

00:10:57.740 --> 00:10:59.540
You'll botch it somehow.

00:10:59.540 --> 00:11:00.490
Say what?!

00:11:00.490 --> 00:11:03.410
The mods you do usually explode.

00:11:03.410 --> 00:11:04.540
Grr!

00:11:04.540 --> 00:11:08.410
Commander! Mission accepted! I'll go!

00:11:08.410 --> 00:11:13.160
Wonderful. I'll have some of
the guys take you there in the van.

00:11:13.160 --> 00:11:16.660
You're in charge, Captain Claudy.

00:11:16.660 --> 00:11:19.040
Me?!

00:11:19.040 --> 00:11:21.990
At your service, Captain Claudy!

00:11:22.950 --> 00:11:25.330
Sigururi!

00:11:27.200 --> 00:11:28.910
Sigururi.

00:11:30.990 --> 00:11:36.410
You know what? Being able to
take you girls is the cherry on the cake!

00:11:36.410 --> 00:11:39.450
My rock-paper-scissors skills paid off!

00:11:39.450 --> 00:11:41.660
This is a mission, not a trip!

00:11:41.660 --> 00:11:44.450
Of course! We know that, but...

00:11:44.450 --> 00:11:50.160
Umihotaru with girls! By itself,
that's enough to get any guy excited!

00:11:50.160 --> 00:11:53.700
Clo, you can ignore whatever they say.

00:11:53.700 --> 00:11:56.660
Sono, you're so mean! But I like it!

00:11:56.660 --> 00:12:00.700
Ooh, I see it! Umihotaru!

00:12:02.740 --> 00:12:04.540
It's bustling.

00:12:04.540 --> 00:12:09.620
They're tough cookies for reopening
when the military gave 'em permission.

00:12:09.620 --> 00:12:12.950
They gave permission before our assessment?

00:12:12.950 --> 00:12:15.620
Huh?! U-Uh, well...

00:12:15.620 --> 00:12:21.200
Claudy! Over here!
They said they'll give us a freebie!

00:12:21.200 --> 00:12:23.160
But, our assessment...

00:12:23.160 --> 00:12:24.660
Let's go, Clo!

00:12:24.660 --> 00:12:27.490
Huh? W-Wait, Sonoka!

00:12:29.330 --> 00:12:31.620
Mmm! It's yummy!

00:12:31.620 --> 00:12:33.870
It really is!

00:12:35.120 --> 00:12:36.740
Delicious!

00:12:37.120 --> 00:12:39.120
Thanks a bunch!

00:12:39.120 --> 00:12:40.620
It was wonderful!

00:12:40.620 --> 00:12:42.660
C'mon! Let's hit the next place!

00:12:42.660 --> 00:12:44.870
W-Wait! The next place?

00:12:44.870 --> 00:12:47.990
Thanks for everything, Miss Valkyrie!

00:12:47.990 --> 00:12:48.660
Huh?

00:12:48.660 --> 00:12:54.160
You guys are our saviors!
We can never thank you enough!

00:12:55.700 --> 00:12:57.490
Pardon me.

00:13:26.410 --> 00:13:29.660
Whew! I think we hit everywhere!

00:13:29.660 --> 00:13:33.370
Everyone gave us freebies! I'm glad we came!

00:13:33.370 --> 00:13:37.410
Hold up. Isn't this mixing
business and pleasure?

00:13:37.410 --> 00:13:42.450
We're soldiers who came here
for a mission, not to play around.

00:13:42.450 --> 00:13:45.040
Don't forget the assessment.

00:13:45.040 --> 00:13:45.790
Here!

00:13:45.790 --> 00:13:47.160
Hmm? What?

00:13:47.160 --> 00:13:50.040
We're doing it right now, Claudy.

00:13:50.660 --> 00:13:56.830
If you take a look around, can't you
see how happy and healthy everyone is?

00:14:03.200 --> 00:14:06.370
Calling it an assessment is overkill.

00:14:06.370 --> 00:14:10.370
But we've been doing our mission properly.

00:14:12.490 --> 00:14:15.410
Hey guys! Is everyone good?!

00:14:15.410 --> 00:14:16.370
Miyako!

00:14:16.370 --> 00:14:17.870
Miko...

00:14:17.870 --> 00:14:19.660
Yeah! Real good!

00:14:19.660 --> 00:14:23.450
Long live the Valkyries! Thanks, you guys!

00:14:23.450 --> 00:14:26.450
Thanks, Valkyrie ladies!

00:14:30.620 --> 00:14:34.410
Now the assessment is complete! Off we go!

00:14:35.830 --> 00:14:37.290
Didn't sleep well?

00:14:37.290 --> 00:14:38.910
Nah...

00:14:38.910 --> 00:14:41.240
Hey! Let's take a break!

00:14:41.240 --> 00:14:42.740
Loquat
Land

00:14:41.240 --> 00:14:42.740
Rest
Area

00:14:41.240 --> 00:14:42.740
Toilets

00:14:41.540 --> 00:14:45.330
Good grief. We've spent all day eating.

00:14:45.330 --> 00:14:47.240
It's fine in moderation!

00:14:47.240 --> 00:14:49.740
Well, I suppose.

00:14:49.740 --> 00:14:52.410
Why did you two come to Tateyama?

00:14:52.410 --> 00:14:54.540
Hmm? Why?

00:14:54.540 --> 00:14:58.990
There's no special reason.
I was told by the commander to come.

00:14:58.990 --> 00:15:04.080
I think I'm here 'cuz I screwed up
at the last place I was at.

00:15:04.080 --> 00:15:07.620
Miko's a problem child who got sent away.

00:15:07.620 --> 00:15:10.410
"Problem child" doesn't sound so good.

00:15:10.410 --> 00:15:16.660
It's no big deal! I just got in trouble
for ignoring orders... with Azu!

00:15:17.370 --> 00:15:21.330
Miko and Azu are an inseparable pair.

00:15:21.330 --> 00:15:23.580
Ever together since training!

00:15:23.580 --> 00:15:25.200
I see.

00:15:25.200 --> 00:15:28.580
I was really worried about being sent away.

00:15:28.580 --> 00:15:34.160
But since I've got Azu, Sono,
and you now, I'm glad I was!

00:15:34.160 --> 00:15:37.240
I'm so thankful for you guys!

00:15:37.240 --> 00:15:38.290
Me too.

00:15:38.830 --> 00:15:40.450
Me too.

00:15:40.450 --> 00:15:43.700
Let's hope you don't kill them this time,

00:15:43.700 --> 00:15:46.080
Grim Reaper Claudia.

00:15:46.080 --> 00:15:48.910
Claudy? What's wrong?

00:15:48.910 --> 00:15:50.120
Azuzu

00:15:48.910 --> 00:15:50.120
Azuzu

00:15:51.830 --> 00:15:53.080
Miko.

00:15:53.080 --> 00:15:56.490
All right! Sorry, but I...

00:15:56.490 --> 00:15:59.370
It's okay. Go on, Miko.

00:15:59.370 --> 00:16:00.700
Right.

00:16:02.790 --> 00:16:05.410
What was that all about?

00:16:06.580 --> 00:16:12.540
Did you know? People sent off
by Valkyries become heroes.

00:16:12.540 --> 00:16:18.410
And it's said that someday,
they can reunite with the people they love.

00:16:18.410 --> 00:16:20.870
That sounds like a fairy-tale.

00:16:20.870 --> 00:16:24.830
Yeah, I think so too.

00:16:24.830 --> 00:16:28.290
But, we live in a world with gods.

00:16:28.290 --> 00:16:32.870
Fairy-tales like that might happen after all.

00:16:39.700 --> 00:16:41.330
You heard?

00:16:41.330 --> 00:16:43.790
Yeah. Is Miyako inside?

00:16:43.790 --> 00:16:45.620
That's right.

00:16:46.370 --> 00:16:49.660
Say, Claudy...

00:16:49.660 --> 00:16:52.580
I need you to hear something.

00:16:55.740 --> 00:17:00.080
You're here too? Where's Miyako?

00:17:03.620 --> 00:17:06.080
Who is she with in there?

00:17:06.080 --> 00:17:11.040
One of the guys that flew recon for Umihotaru.

00:17:11.040 --> 00:17:14.910
He was protecting his comrades.

00:17:14.910 --> 00:17:17.830
That's when...

00:17:17.830 --> 00:17:21.910
I tell her it's superstition
for Valkyries to send people off,

00:17:21.910 --> 00:17:24.790
but that fool doesn't listen.

00:17:24.790 --> 00:17:28.290
She always does it... like an idiot.

00:17:28.290 --> 00:17:32.200
I get you all to myself, Miko?

00:17:32.200 --> 00:17:35.870
The guys will be so jealous of me.

00:17:35.870 --> 00:17:41.160
Don't worry about it!
They'll let it slide 'cuz you're hurt!

00:17:41.160 --> 00:17:44.160
I wonder.

00:17:44.160 --> 00:17:48.540
You're the best, Miko. What a good woman.

00:17:48.540 --> 00:17:52.370
Yeah? What's so good about me?

00:17:52.370 --> 00:17:56.160
First of all, your long hair.

00:17:56.160 --> 00:18:00.580
You work in the kitchen,
but your hands are so smooth.

00:18:00.580 --> 00:18:03.620
Your big, bright eyes...

00:18:03.620 --> 00:18:08.490
Not crying when saying goodbye... and...

00:18:08.490 --> 00:18:10.200
And?

00:18:10.200 --> 00:18:14.790
That you'll live much longer than me.

00:18:16.160 --> 00:18:19.580
Oh, I see. Maybe.

00:18:19.580 --> 00:18:25.620
He's been bad since last night.
It's a miracle he's conscious again.

00:18:25.620 --> 00:18:27.740
Since last night?

00:18:27.740 --> 00:18:31.330
I've got plenty of reasons for losing sleep.

00:18:34.410 --> 00:18:37.120
You're gonna regret it.

00:18:37.120 --> 00:18:41.330
You don't have to be stupid like that idiot.

00:18:41.330 --> 00:18:47.620
I'm a problem child that
was sent to Tateyama too.

00:18:47.620 --> 00:18:49.330
You idiot.

00:18:51.990 --> 00:18:54.410
Oh, Claudy?

00:18:56.700 --> 00:18:59.990
M-Miko?

00:18:59.990 --> 00:19:04.660
I'm here. I'm right beside you.

00:19:55.790 --> 00:19:58.200
Kanae...

00:20:05.450 --> 00:20:08.700
Rest in peace. Thank you.

00:20:15.950 --> 00:20:21.580
I know it's a cruel burden to bear,
but we're grateful.

00:20:21.580 --> 00:20:26.490
If there's a Valkyrie there,
we know that we'll never die alone.

00:20:26.490 --> 00:20:29.370
We can believe.

00:20:29.370 --> 00:20:35.160
I'm sorry. All you guys do
is save us, time and time again.

00:20:39.080 --> 00:20:43.910
Named Valkyrie Schwertleite.

00:20:46.790 --> 00:20:52.910
Grim Reaper? I've only felt sorry
for myself and saw what I wanted to.

00:20:55.330 --> 00:20:59.040
I'm... the weakest of all.

00:21:17.160 --> 00:21:20.540
Huh? You've been here all along?

00:21:20.540 --> 00:21:23.410
You should've said so!

00:21:23.410 --> 00:21:27.950
What's up? You don't look so good.

00:21:27.950 --> 00:21:29.580
Miyako...

00:21:29.580 --> 00:21:31.160
Hmm?

00:21:31.160 --> 00:21:36.540
It's nothing. I had stuff on
my mind and couldn't sleep much.

00:21:36.540 --> 00:21:39.410
Oh? That's not like you.

00:21:39.410 --> 00:21:43.330
A good start to the day
is the soldier way, right?

00:21:43.330 --> 00:21:46.080
Miyako, can I ask something?

00:21:46.080 --> 00:21:47.240
Huh?

00:21:47.240 --> 00:21:51.160
Miyako... How are you so strong?

00:21:55.870 --> 00:21:58.870
I don't think I'm strong at all.

00:21:59.830 --> 00:22:06.830
But if you think I'm strong,
I'd be happy to share my secret with you!

00:22:08.790 --> 00:22:10.490
And that's...

00:22:11.200 --> 00:22:11.950
"Cafeteria"

00:22:12.870 --> 00:22:18.410
The secret of strength is eating
all foods without being picky!

00:22:18.410 --> 00:22:20.410
She's at it again.

00:22:20.410 --> 00:22:22.660
It's her philosophy.

00:22:22.660 --> 00:22:25.830
Would you two please be quiet?

00:22:32.160 --> 00:22:34.330
Delicious!

00:22:34.330 --> 00:22:35.910
Right?

00:23:56.990 --> 00:23:59.120
Immovable Mind

00:23:57.540 --> 00:23:59.120
Battle after battle!

00:23:59.120 --> 00:24:02.450
Men of the base fight
for the Valkyries' attention!

00:24:02.450 --> 00:24:04.160
Yesterday's friend is today's enemy!

00:24:04.160 --> 00:24:05.040
Cry not, brothers!

00:24:05.040 --> 00:24:05.790
Listen up!

00:24:05.790 --> 00:24:07.870
We have something to say!

00:24:07.870 --> 00:24:12.040
Ah! Our date with
the girls was so much fun!

00:24:09.080 --> 00:24:12.040
Episode 4
 Tateyama Castle Swimsuit Skirmish

00:24:09.080 --> 00:24:12.040
Next Time
